---
const repository = 'https://github.com/ShepiTT/CET_practice_questions';
const version = '1.2.1';
const release = `${repository}/releases/tag/v${version}`;
const assets = `${repository}/releases/download/v${version}`;
const title = '英语四六级真题练习';
const description = '按卷刷题、练专项、听录音、复习错题。下载 Windows 版，离线练习 CET-4 和 CET-6 真题。';
const canonical = new URL('/projects/cet/', Astro.site);
const screenshot = new URL('/projects/cet/home.jpg', Astro.site);
const editions = [
  {
    title: 'Windows 桌面版',
    description: '用独立窗口刷题。适合电脑已装 Edge WebView2 和 .NET 运行环境的同学。',
    executable: 'CETPractice.exe',
    url: `${assets}/cet-practice-${version}-windows-desktop-x64.zip`,
    label: '下载桌面版',
  },
  {
    title: 'Windows 网页启动器',
    description: '用默认浏览器刷题。练完后，在启动器控制窗点「关闭服务」。',
    executable: 'CETPractice-Web.exe',
    url: `${assets}/cet-practice-${version}-windows-web-launcher-x64.zip`,
    label: '下载网页启动器',
  },
];
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>{title} · Lxx的日常</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <link rel="canonical" href={canonical} />
    <link rel="icon" href="/projects/cet/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
    <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:image" content={screenshot} />
    <meta property="og:url" content={canonical} />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip" href="#main">跳到正文</a>
    <header class="shell site-header">
      <a class="wordmark" href="/projects/cet/">
        <img src="/projects/cet/favicon.svg" width="30" height="30" alt="" />
        <strong>CET</strong><span>真题练习</span>
      </a>
      <nav aria-label="项目导航">
        <a href="/about/#projects-title">返回博客</a>
        <a href={repository}>GitHub 源码 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main id="main" class="shell">
      <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="page-title">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">CET-4 <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> CET-6</p>
          <h1 id="page-title">英语四六级<br /><mark>真题练习</mark></h1>
          <p class="lede">按年份做整套真题，也可以只练听力、阅读等专项。做完看解析，把错题留到下次复习。</p>
          <a class="button button-primary" href="#downloads">下载 Windows 版 <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
          <dl class="stats">
            <div><dt>套真题</dt><dd>94</dd></div>
            <div><dt>道客观题</dt><dd>5,064</dd></div>
            <div><dt>试卷年份</dt><dd>2019–2026</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </div>
        <figure class="hero-shot">
          <a href="/projects/cet/home.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="新标签页查看完整首页截图">
            <img src="/projects/cet/home.jpg" width="1265" height="712" alt="刷题系统首页，显示练习进度和专项刷题入口" fetchpriority="high" />
          </a>
          <figcaption>刷题系统首页 <a href="/projects/cet/home.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">查看大图 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></figcaption>
        </figure>
      </section>

      <section class="section" id="downloads" aria-labelledby="download-title">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <h2 id="download-title">下载与使用</h2>
            <p>支持 Windows 10/11 x64，无需安装 Python。</p>
          </div>
          <a class="version" href={release} aria-label={`查看 v${version} 版本说明`}>v{version} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="download-grid">
          {editions.map((edition) => (
            <article class="download-card">
              <h3>{edition.title}</h3>
              <p>{edition.description}</p>
              <p class="run">完整解压后运行 <code>{edition.executable}</code></p>
              <div class="download-action">
                <a class="button button-primary" href={edition.url}>{edition.label} <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
                <span>ZIP · 约 835 MiB</span>
              </div>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
        <div class="download-notes">
          <p>两个版本都自带题库、试卷、答案 PDF 和听力音频，可离线练习。练习进度和错题保存在本机。升级前请先退出旧程序，再解压到新文件夹。</p>
          <p>下载的是未签名便携版，请保留完整解压目录。<a href={`${assets}/SHA256SUMS.txt`}>查看 SHA-256 校验值</a> · <a href={release}>查看版本说明</a></p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" aria-labelledby="screens-title">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2 id="screens-title">界面预览</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="screen-grid">
          <figure>
            <a href="/projects/cet/special-practice.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="新标签页查看完整专项刷题截图">
              <img src="/projects/cet/special-practice.jpg" width="1265" height="712" alt="专项刷题界面，选择考试等级、题组数量和题型" loading="lazy" />
            </a>
            <figcaption>
              <strong>专项刷题</strong>
              <p>按四级、六级筛选，集中练听力、选词填空、段落匹配或仔细阅读。</p>
            </figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure>
            <a href="/projects/cet/listening-practice.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="新标签页查看完整听力练习截图">
              <img src="/projects/cet/listening-practice.jpg" width="1265" height="712" alt="听力练习界面，同页显示录音控件、原文入口和答题选项" loading="lazy" />
            </a>
            <figcaption>
              <strong>听力练习</strong>
              <p>从当前题组的起点播放录音，按需展开原文和解析。</p>
            </figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="shell site-footer">
      <a href="/about/#projects-title"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> 返回「关于我」</a>
      <a href={repository}>GitHub 源码 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(:root) {
    color-scheme: light;
    --paper: #f3f0e8;
    --sheet: #fcfbf7;
    --ink: #1a1f2e;
    --quiet: #474d5e;
    --rule: #ddd8cb;
    --strong-rule: #c6c0b0;
    --blue: #2a46a6;
    --marker: #ffd84d;
    --frame: #fffdfa;
    --button: #1a1f2e;
    --button-text: #fcfbf7;
    --shadow: 0 18px 38px -28px rgba(26, 31, 46, .4);
    --sans: "Segoe UI", "Microsoft YaHei UI", "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", "Noto Sans CJK SC", system-ui, sans-serif;
    --serif: "Sitka Heading", Georgia, "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", "Noto Sans CJK SC", serif;
    --mono: "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, ui-monospace, monospace;
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
  }

  :global(*), :global(*::before), :global(*::after) { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { margin: 0; color: var(--ink); background: var(--paper); font: 16px/1.65 var(--sans); }
  .shell { width: min(1180px, calc(100% - clamp(32px, 8vw, 100px))); margin-inline: auto; }
  a { color: inherit; text-underline-offset: .22em; }
  a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--blue); outline-offset: 4px; }
  .skip { position: absolute; top: 8px; left: 8px; z-index: 1; padding: 6px 12px; background: var(--sheet); transform: translateY(-150%); }
  .skip:focus { transform: none; }
  .site-header, .site-footer {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px 24px;
    padding-block: 17px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .wordmark, nav, .site-footer { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; }
  .wordmark { gap: 7px; text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap; }
  .wordmark img { display: block; }
  .wordmark strong { font: 700 23px/1 var(--serif); }
  .wordmark span { padding-left: 9px; margin-left: 3px; border-left: 1px solid var(--rule); color: var(--quiet); font-size: 13px; }
  nav { justify-content: flex-end; gap: 8px clamp(12px, 2.3vw, 26px); }
  nav a, .site-footer a { color: var(--quiet); font-size: 14px; text-decoration: none; }
  nav a:hover, .site-footer a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .hero {
    display: grid; align-items: center; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 4fr) minmax(0, 6fr);
    gap: clamp(24px, 5vw, 68px); padding-block: clamp(44px, 6.5vw, 90px) clamp(38px, 5.5vw, 68px);
  }
  .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 12px; color: var(--quiet); font: 600 13px/1.4 var(--mono); letter-spacing: .13em; }
  .eyebrow span { margin-inline: 4px; }
  h1, h2, h3, p, figure, dl, dd { margin: 0; }
  h1 { font: 650 clamp(40px, 5.3vw, 75px)/1.12 var(--serif); letter-spacing: -.045em; }
  mark {
    padding-inline: .04em .08em; color: inherit;
    background: linear-gradient(transparent 72%, var(--marker) 72%, var(--marker) 94%, transparent 94%);
  }
  .lede { margin-block: 20px; max-width: 29em; color: var(--quiet); }
  .button {
    display: inline-flex; gap: 9px; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 44px;
    padding: 9px 15px; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 9px;
    font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; text-align: center;
  }
  .button-primary { background: var(--button); color: var(--button-text); }
  .button-primary:hover { background: var(--blue); color: #fff; }
  .stats { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px 21px; margin-top: 28px; padding-top: 18px; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .stats div { display: flex; flex-direction: column-reverse; gap: 3px; }
  .stats dd { font: 700 clamp(19px, 2vw, 27px)/1.1 var(--serif); font-variant-numeric: lining-nums tabular-nums; }
  .stats dt { color: var(--quiet); font-size: 12px; }
  .hero-shot, .screen-grid figure {
    min-width: 0; padding: 8px; background: var(--sheet); border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: 15px; box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }
  figure > a { display: block; border-radius: 8px; }
  figure img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 8px; background: var(--frame); }
  .hero-shot figcaption { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; padding: 9px 5px 2px; color: var(--quiet); font-size: 13px; }
  .hero-shot figcaption a, .download-notes a { color: var(--blue); }
  .section { padding-block: 23px 44px; border-top: 4px double var(--ink); scroll-margin-top: 16px; }
  .section-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 17px; }
  .section-head h2 { font: 650 clamp(26px, 3vw, 35px)/1.2 var(--serif); }
  .section-head p { margin-top: 6px; color: var(--quiet); }
  .version {
    padding: 3px 8px; border: 1px solid var(--strong-rule); border-radius: 6px;
    font: 600 13px/1.5 var(--mono); text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .version:hover { border-color: var(--blue); text-decoration: underline; }
  .download-grid, .screen-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }
  .download-card {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: clamp(16px, 2.4vw, 26px); background: var(--sheet);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 15px; box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }
  h3 { margin-bottom: 7px; font: 650 23px/1.3 var(--serif); }
  .download-card p, .download-notes, .screen-grid figcaption p { color: var(--quiet); font-size: 14px; }
  .download-card .run { margin-block: 9px 17px; }
  .run code { color: var(--ink); font: 600 13px/1.5 var(--mono); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .download-action { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 8px 13px; margin-top: auto; color: var(--quiet); font-size: 12px; }
  .download-notes { display: grid; gap: 5px; margin-top: 14px; }
  .screen-grid figcaption { padding: 10px 9px 7px; }
  .screen-grid figcaption strong { font-size: 17px; }
  .screen-grid figcaption p { margin-top: 3px; }
  .site-footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); border-bottom: 0; padding-block: 20px 30px; }

  @media (max-width: 780px) {
    .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .stats { max-width: 29em; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .download-grid, .screen-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 390px) {
    .wordmark span { display: none; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    :global(:root) { scroll-behavior: auto; }
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :global(:root) {
      color-scheme: dark;
      --paper: #121419;
      --sheet: #191c23;
      --ink: #ece8dd;
      --quiet: #bdb9ae;
      --rule: #2b2f39;
      --strong-rule: #575c69;
      --blue: #a3b6ff;
      --marker: #806824;
      --frame: #1f222a;
      --button: #ffd84d;
      --button-text: #1a1f2e;
      --shadow: 0 18px 38px -28px rgba(0, 0, 0, .85);
    }
    .button-primary:hover { color: #1a1f2e; }
  }
</style>
